B.bYi=new A.fP(B.GA,"10-Second Express Counter Billing & Atomic Seat Parity","Lightning-fast cash payment recording with instant digital receipts and zero-drift concurrency safety ensuring double-seat allocations are completely prevented.","Billing & Parity","point_of_sale","/admin/home","Collect Fee")
B.bYj=new A.fP(B.jv,"Silent Reception & Noise Help Button","Study in complete peace. Discreetly alert reception about noise, AC temperature, Wi-Fi issues, or desk hygiene without leaving your seat or causing a disturbance.","Quiet Study","volume_off","/student/feedback","Explore Help Desk")
